# Build context exclusions.
#
# The Space builds from a directory populated by deploy_space.py, which already
# contains only the deploy set. This file matters for LOCAL builds from the source
# tree, where the context would otherwise include the virtualenv, the git history
# and -- the one that actually matters -- .env with live API keys, which would be
# baked into an image layer and survive any later deletion.

# Secrets. Keys belong in the Space's Settings -> Secrets, never in a layer.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.streamlit/secrets.toml

# Virtualenv and VCS: gigabytes of context, none of it used.
.venv/
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# The Space checkout itself -- a second git repo.
.space/

# Corpus: downloadable, and not needed at runtime. The index in chroma/ is what
# the app reads; pages.jsonl and chunks.jsonl are build-time artifacts.
data/

# Documentation, tooling and caches.
Docs/
deploy_space.py
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
